(text "Pin n of XPk (display board, male, on its back) mates pin n of XSk (driver board, female, on its face).\nThe order of every strip is the order the display board's copper arrives in (tools/ts06pair.py HEADERS)."
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 50.8 30.48 0)
